* @title Snapshot all variables with DUMP
* @match substring
* @expect >>>
* FRUIT = 'apple'
* <<<
* DUMP(1) prints every natural variable and its current value -- a quick way to
* see program state. The listing mixes the built-in pattern variables (ABORT,
* ARB, ...) with the program's own, in storage order, so we match a single
* known line rather than the whole dump.
        FRUIT = 'apple'
        BASKETS = 3
        DUMP(1)
END
